WEBVTT

00:00:01.130 --> 00:00:04.830
Infinite Ryvius

00:00:04.830 --> 00:00:06.000
Infinite Ryvius
<i>Message to everyone aboard. We've</i>
<i>located the silhouette of an enemy ship.</i>

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.470
<i>Message to everyone aboard. We've</i>
<i>located the silhouette of an enemy ship.</i>

00:00:07.870 --> 00:00:10.100
<i>They will be closest to</i>
<i>us in about three hours.</i>

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:13.940
<i>This is your opportunity to earn points.</i>
<i>If you wanna eat, work for it!</i>

00:00:14.710 --> 00:00:16.110
We're doing our best
without having to be told!

00:00:16.110 --> 00:00:17.410
Charlotte!

00:00:22.780 --> 00:00:26.850
<i>We're switching sections 45</i>
<i>to 85 from phase B to phase A.</i>

00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:30.780
I'm going to the Vital Guarder.
I'll leave the Ryvius in your hands.

00:00:31.030 --> 00:00:31.650
<i>Roger!</i>

00:00:31.890 --> 00:00:33.920
Are they just simply headed toward us?

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:37.530
The neutrino pinger is clearly responding.
I trust the information is accurate.

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:43.290
I detect a slight warp
surrounding the enemy.

00:00:43.470 --> 00:00:45.370
Probably because it's inside the Geduld.

00:00:46.470 --> 00:00:47.870
Sorry we're late.

00:00:51.850 --> 00:00:53.510
We were beginning to get used to it all.

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:57.140
The anxiety. The battles.
Being ordered around.

00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:00.820
We felt we could live with it, because
there was no risk to our lives.

00:01:02.190 --> 00:01:03.820
Because we have the Vital Guarder.

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:07.290
The ultimate power.

00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:12.290
Vital Guarder.

00:01:12.770 --> 00:01:16.360
Infinite Ryvius

00:01:17.040 --> 00:01:23.910
If you're going to walk, right here will be fine

00:01:24.910 --> 00:01:27.920
Although loneliness...

00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:32.250
...can sometimes be unbearable

00:01:32.750 --> 00:01:39.490
There's the benefit of not hurting anyone...

00:01:40.630 --> 00:01:44.570
...and the benefit of not being exposed...

00:01:44.570 --> 00:01:47.530
...and hurt by others as well

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:55.070
At the opposite side of the frozen sea...

00:01:55.840 --> 00:01:58.850
...the dream and the reality...

00:01:58.850 --> 00:02:02.480
...that you saw cross paths

00:02:02.650 --> 00:02:06.180
Some light is shed...

00:02:06.850 --> 00:02:10.760
...but how it is done is unknown...

00:02:10.760 --> 00:02:17.990
...so that we can go to a different place

00:02:18.470 --> 00:02:26.000
The things I want have no shape

00:02:26.270 --> 00:02:34.410
Tear the final universe, today until tomorrow

00:02:45.230 --> 00:02:48.680
To Be Too Conscious

00:02:52.230 --> 00:02:53.270
Where's the enemy?

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:54.060
Inside the Geduld.

00:02:54.330 --> 00:02:56.700
Why don't we go ahead and
send out the Vital Guarder?

00:02:56.800 --> 00:02:59.930
You fool. We're also in the Geduld.

00:03:00.440 --> 00:03:02.010
So I'm a fool.

00:03:02.010 --> 00:03:03.480
Neutrino pinger reacting!

00:03:04.610 --> 00:03:05.950
Triple bingo!

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:08.010
Target, moving at a speed of 0.4 herschels.

00:03:08.150 --> 00:03:09.240
Wow! That's fast!

00:03:09.550 --> 00:03:11.350
That's reason for worry.

00:03:11.350 --> 00:03:13.880
That and the earlier figures
indicating a gravitational field warp.

00:03:14.350 --> 00:03:18.290
You're being a pest!
Just focus on our ascent!

00:03:19.160 --> 00:03:19.920
Very well.

00:03:22.530 --> 00:03:24.360
Charlie! Stop daydreaming!

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:25.560
Oh, sorry.

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:30.300
<i>The enemy just continues to come.</i>

00:03:30.800 --> 00:03:33.170
End of phase two. Entering phase three.

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:35.010
I'm done as well.

00:03:35.010 --> 00:03:36.410
Roger, roger.

00:03:36.410 --> 00:03:40.710
Listen. Be ready to go in two hours.
I don't want anyone saying it's imposs...!

00:03:40.710 --> 00:03:42.050
You're disturbing my concentration!

00:03:42.350 --> 00:03:44.580
If you're not going to do anything,
then just sit and be quiet!

00:03:52.490 --> 00:03:55.950
Yuki. I ask you, please
live more peacefully.

00:03:57.730 --> 00:03:59.320
No way.

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:04.030
Installing secret weapon.

00:04:06.570 --> 00:04:12.340
<i>The partitions of sections 12 to 56 and</i>
<i>115 to 138 will close in five minutes.</i>

00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:15.820
<i>I repeat. The partitions of sections</i>
<i>12 to 56 and 115 to 138 will close!</i>

00:04:15.820 --> 00:04:19.880
Points will be confiscated from those
violating rules. You there, keep working!

00:04:29.860 --> 00:04:31.850
Maybe we shouldn't do this?

00:04:32.100 --> 00:04:34.760
Our best chance is right
now before battle begins.

00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:36.800
You're hungry, aren't you?

00:04:36.800 --> 00:04:38.530
Well, yeah, but...

00:04:38.770 --> 00:04:40.930
Leave it to me.

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:42.770
I'll get you...!

00:04:49.480 --> 00:04:50.920
What are you doing?

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:57.920
I'm bored.

00:04:57.920 --> 00:04:58.950
W-Wait until later.

00:05:01.930 --> 00:05:05.190
You never come no matter
how often we invite you.

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:07.230
Stop it. I'm working.

00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:09.900
Come on. I know you enjoy it.

00:05:10.170 --> 00:05:12.170
I have no interest in women.

00:05:12.170 --> 00:05:14.210
We have less than two hours
before the enemy gets here.

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:16.270
Stop running from man to man, Criff!

00:05:17.140 --> 00:05:18.470
Criff...!

00:05:22.980 --> 00:05:24.470
What's wrong?

00:05:24.650 --> 00:05:27.520
Well, um, just hypothetically speaking...!

00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:31.420
If your boyfriend cheated on you,
how would you react, Faina?

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:33.590
I would never forgive him.

00:05:34.960 --> 00:05:36.220
I would never forgive you, Kouji.

00:05:36.460 --> 00:05:37.560
Me?

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:40.030
Because you've become my
boyfriend, right Kouji?

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:45.260
Ah, is that how it is?
I never knew. Seriously.

00:05:45.910 --> 00:05:47.670
Remember that.

00:05:48.310 --> 00:05:49.780
Right.

00:05:55.820 --> 00:05:57.120
Wow!

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:59.680
No, no. You can't see this!

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:02.720
Oh, man. My first time was
an accident? That's too much!

00:06:02.720 --> 00:06:04.290
Huh? What?

00:06:04.290 --> 00:06:05.720
Nothing at all.

00:06:11.500 --> 00:06:12.800
<i>This is an announcement from the bridge.</i>

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:14.830
<i>The Ryvius will be ascending in two minutes.</i>

00:06:14.830 --> 00:06:16.570
- <i>One hour after our ascent...</i>
- Be assured, Pat.

00:06:16.570 --> 00:06:19.570
- <i>... we will send out the Vital Guarder.</i>
- In battle, we will always win!

00:06:19.570 --> 00:06:22.540
- <i>We will be switching to backup power...</i>
- 'Cause the people I oversee are running it.

00:06:23.240 --> 00:06:25.250
- <i>... so workers are asked to stop their work.</i>
- I don't believe what you say, Lucson.

00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:26.950
- <i>Estimated battle time...</i>
- You're always lying.

00:06:26.950 --> 00:06:28.580
- <i>... is 7 hours and 20 minutes.</i>
- What do you mean?

00:06:28.580 --> 00:06:30.950
- <i>Please return to work in eight hours.</i>
- I'm still giving them orders, you know.

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:32.450
- <i>I repeat.</i>
- Okay, just watch!

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:34.780
- <i>The Ryvius will be ascending in...</i>
- Commence the Ryvius' ascent!

00:06:39.730 --> 00:06:41.750
Stance Control Solid complete!

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:45.760
As expected, we're at 54,700 serades
from the vicinity of Saturn.

00:06:45.930 --> 00:06:48.200
Our speed is stable at 0.02 herschels.

00:06:48.570 --> 00:06:50.540
Recovering image.

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:52.340
That's Titan and Saturn.

00:06:52.840 --> 00:06:54.270
I've never seen this live before.

00:06:54.270 --> 00:06:56.610
Now, where's the machine that
wants us to kick their ass?

00:06:56.610 --> 00:06:58.630
The pinger's responding, but...!

00:07:01.680 --> 00:07:03.170
Why is it responding like this?

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:05.420
No ship can take this route!

00:07:05.720 --> 00:07:07.390
I thought I told you.

00:07:07.390 --> 00:07:10.380
The gravitational field warp
figures of the enemy are too great.

00:07:11.060 --> 00:07:13.490
Shut up. Can you do
nothing but speak logic?

00:07:13.890 --> 00:07:16.120
Kouji, forward this data to the Lift Ship.

00:07:16.800 --> 00:07:17.320
Okay.

00:07:27.570 --> 00:07:29.540
I received the data, big brother.

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:31.370
How dare you!

00:07:32.610 --> 00:07:34.600
Kouji. These figures are way outta whack.

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:36.350
The meter must be malfunctioning.

00:07:36.620 --> 00:07:37.950
<i>We've checked it a number of times.</i>

00:07:38.450 --> 00:07:40.920
If the data's accurate,
we could be in great trouble.

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:43.420
Sounds like fun.
I was beginning to get bored.

00:07:44.020 --> 00:07:46.960
<i>Message from Fu. He'd like to</i>
<i>hear what Blue's opinion is.</i>

00:07:47.390 --> 00:07:49.880
We'll take the initiative.
Fire the main cannon.

00:07:50.260 --> 00:07:51.900
You're thinking too simplistically.

00:07:51.900 --> 00:07:54.730
Get us at least three takes of
course altering Solids right away.

00:07:55.030 --> 00:07:55.630
We're attacking.

00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:57.590
We'll never hit 'em.

00:07:57.970 --> 00:07:59.300
He says attack with our main cannon.

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:03.540
Okay! Release the firearm
control lock! Charlie! Char...!

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:07.900
Wow, so soft.

00:08:08.110 --> 00:08:09.450
Y-You're embarrassing me.

00:08:10.750 --> 00:08:13.310
Wh-Why Eins, of all people?

00:08:14.250 --> 00:08:15.380
Charlie!

00:08:16.120 --> 00:08:17.320
He's been dumped.

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:19.360
What a pity.

00:08:25.430 --> 00:08:26.900
Look, he's crying.

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:28.470
You were serious about her?

00:08:29.370 --> 00:08:31.300
Didn't you realize you were being used?

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:34.570
You're entertaining, but put
it to rest and return to work!

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:36.310
Are you serious about firing the cannon?

00:08:36.310 --> 00:08:39.110
That would be meaningless. We'd be
giving away our position to the enemy.

00:08:39.850 --> 00:08:41.580
They're Blue's orders! Do it!

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:42.710
Very well.

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:46.450
Anti-ship steel bullet loading complete.

00:08:46.990 --> 00:08:49.320
East, internal voltage surpassed
20 thousand giga giosues.

00:08:49.590 --> 00:08:51.390
West, increasing from 12 to 13 thousand.

00:08:51.960 --> 00:08:55.620
26 thousand, 28 thousand,
east now reaching 30 thousand.

00:08:56.030 --> 00:08:57.830
Act 1, ready to fire.

00:08:58.460 --> 00:09:00.660
Set aim to the enemy's
expected arrival position.

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:02.900
You think it'll hit?

00:09:02.900 --> 00:09:03.870
Impossible.

00:09:03.870 --> 00:09:05.390
Hey, let me do it! Let me push it!

00:09:06.810 --> 00:09:08.240
Well, okay, then.

00:09:08.240 --> 00:09:11.010
Make sure you time it right.
Aim for the enemy's course...!

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:12.910
Not yet!!

00:09:15.080 --> 00:09:16.550
You fool!

00:09:17.980 --> 00:09:19.520
Oops. I got it wrong.

00:09:19.520 --> 00:09:20.420
Damn you!

00:09:20.490 --> 00:09:22.760
- I'll do it right the next time.
- <i>What a foolish thing to do.</i>

00:09:22.760 --> 00:09:24.280
You're never getting near this again!

00:09:24.490 --> 00:09:26.460
- You don't hafta be so stingy!
- Act one, complete.

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:29.330
East, maintaining present voltage,
and proceeding to load.

00:09:29.830 --> 00:09:33.600
West, voltage at 18 thousand, 20
thousand, 23 thousand, 27 thousand...!

00:09:34.100 --> 00:09:35.570
Act one will arrive at hit
point in less than 15 seconds.

00:09:35.570 --> 00:09:37.040
Aren't you nervous?

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:41.200
No, because I'm aboard the Ryvius.

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:45.840
I believe this ship will give
me a lift toward my future.

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:47.540
Your future?

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:51.040
Huh? Did it hit?

00:09:51.420 --> 00:09:52.480
It hit the Geduld.

00:09:52.720 --> 00:09:54.410
West surpassed 30 thousand volts.

00:09:57.090 --> 00:09:58.560
Commence Act two!

00:10:01.290 --> 00:10:02.700
Act two complete.

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:05.530
East, maintain voltage as you
load bullets for next firing.

00:10:11.700 --> 00:10:14.800
All puppet wire links from
branch A to B all green.

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:18.070
<i>Can't the Vital Guarder take off yet?</i>

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:20.210
We just cleared phase five.

00:10:20.710 --> 00:10:24.320
But more importantly, you're needlessly
firing the main cannon too much.

00:10:24.320 --> 00:10:25.790
Can't you stop it?

00:10:25.790 --> 00:10:27.910
We'd face problems because
we can't do maintenance on our own.

00:10:28.450 --> 00:10:31.650
<i>You would have to give us orders</i>
<i>to allow us to change our tactics.</i>

00:10:32.060 --> 00:10:33.860
Y-You're right.

00:10:45.570 --> 00:10:48.560
<i>To Lift ship. Act eight complete.</i>
<i>No response from enemy.</i>

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:51.010
We'll enter Act nine in five minutes.

00:10:51.940 --> 00:10:53.140
The pinger's picked up something!

00:10:53.550 --> 00:10:55.280
As we feared, it seems unharmed.

00:10:55.280 --> 00:10:57.440
We're facing the worst-case
scenario, as I expected.

00:11:15.970 --> 00:11:16.960
Who...

00:11:17.170 --> 00:11:18.230
...are you?

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:23.710
Why did it have to be Kouji?

00:11:27.350 --> 00:11:29.310
That's... bad.

00:11:34.720 --> 00:11:36.150
Infinite Ryvius

00:11:39.630 --> 00:11:41.020
Infinite Ryvius

00:11:44.030 --> 00:11:46.530
Reactor power at full output.

00:11:46.530 --> 00:11:50.800
Copy that. Couplings primed
and ready for release.

00:11:50.800 --> 00:11:52.310
Enemy vessel sighted!

00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:54.100
Gravitational field warp surpassing 17!

00:11:54.410 --> 00:11:56.380
Estimated mass, 24 thousand darcs!

00:11:56.980 --> 00:11:58.240
I-Impossible.

00:11:58.680 --> 00:12:02.270
Within an error factor of 0.002 serades,
they're gonna hit us as they pass?

00:12:03.120 --> 00:12:04.380
We're gonna hit in space?

00:12:04.380 --> 00:12:06.450
The odds of that happening
are a billion to one!

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:08.450
This is one miracle I'd rather avoid!

00:12:08.450 --> 00:12:11.080
<i>Kreis. Develop our field ahead of us.</i>

00:12:11.420 --> 00:12:12.360
Gotcha.

00:12:12.360 --> 00:12:15.020
It's not a ship in the database.
Could it be...?

00:12:15.630 --> 00:12:18.150
Two minutes before contact!
They're heading straight for us!

00:12:20.200 --> 00:12:21.230
We need to escape!

00:12:21.230 --> 00:12:22.600
How?

00:12:22.600 --> 00:12:23.530
I-I don't know, but...!

00:12:26.210 --> 00:12:27.400
Use our main cannon! Destroy it!

00:12:28.240 --> 00:12:29.500
Not from such close proximity!

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:31.400
Hurry, or it'll get here!

00:12:32.150 --> 00:12:33.270
Take this!

00:12:39.490 --> 00:12:40.390
I missed? From this distance?

00:12:40.390 --> 00:12:43.750
- You've gotta be kidding.
- But it's coming from straight ahead.

00:12:44.020 --> 00:12:46.360
35 seconds to contact. We're gonna hit.

00:12:46.690 --> 00:12:47.690
This can't be.

00:12:47.690 --> 00:12:49.720
Kouji. You've gotta secure
yourself in your seat.

00:12:50.460 --> 00:12:51.430
R-Right.

00:12:54.170 --> 00:12:55.070
Criff!

00:12:55.470 --> 00:12:56.460
25 seconds!

00:12:56.800 --> 00:13:01.140
24, 23, 22, 21, 20, 19, 18, 17...!

00:13:01.140 --> 00:13:02.470
Kouji. Make an announcement
to warn everyone!

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:04.240
You're right.

00:13:04.240 --> 00:13:07.510
<i>Everybody, grab onto something quickly.</i>
<i>The enemy vessel is about to ram into us!</i>

00:13:08.350 --> 00:13:09.680
- Kouji?
- You're too late!

00:13:09.880 --> 00:13:10.850
It's coming!

00:13:14.590 --> 00:13:18.720
Why? What are you doing?
What would you like to do?

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:27.690
Mother!

00:13:35.510 --> 00:13:37.140
The enemy ship's course has changed.

00:13:37.610 --> 00:13:40.410
The resulting discrepancy in the Ryvius'
course is within adjustable range.

00:13:41.050 --> 00:13:42.510
All right! All right!

00:13:43.180 --> 00:13:45.650
Boy, that wasn't that big a deal.

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:46.890
Darn.

00:13:49.020 --> 00:13:50.490
We're safe.

00:13:52.120 --> 00:13:53.520
Because I believed.

00:13:59.700 --> 00:14:00.760
We avoided them.

00:14:02.470 --> 00:14:04.300
I-I'm sorry!

00:14:04.800 --> 00:14:06.070
Hurry with preparations to take off.

00:14:10.740 --> 00:14:14.180
Captain. They've evaded our
ship's specialty charge.

00:14:14.810 --> 00:14:16.480
Begin counter-rotation at top speed.

00:14:16.850 --> 00:14:18.710
Beginning counter-rotation at top speed.

00:14:20.090 --> 00:14:23.020
<i>Everybody, the enemy vessel has</i>
<i>changed its course and left the area.</i>

00:14:23.560 --> 00:14:25.060
<i>Everything's okay now.</i>

00:14:25.060 --> 00:14:26.420
Kouji, you fool!

00:14:26.760 --> 00:14:28.560
I've finished analyzing the enemy vessel.

00:14:28.860 --> 00:14:30.450
- The model is unknown.
- Again?

00:14:31.030 --> 00:14:32.230
I'll bring up an image
of it when it passed us.

00:14:32.230 --> 00:14:33.770
What is this unusual shape?

00:14:33.770 --> 00:14:35.760
Estimated length, 1.3 kilometers.

00:14:36.240 --> 00:14:37.860
That's larger than the Ryvius!

00:14:38.370 --> 00:14:41.070
<i>Where'd you get this data?</i>
<i>Is this supposed to be some joke?</i>

00:14:41.440 --> 00:14:42.410
Look!

00:14:42.780 --> 00:14:44.140
Wait a sec.

00:14:44.910 --> 00:14:46.740
Here's data on the bullet
course of Act nine.

00:14:47.450 --> 00:14:49.680
It was directed at the course
the enemy was traveling, but...!

00:14:50.320 --> 00:14:51.180
It curved?

00:14:51.580 --> 00:14:53.280
You mean, they have
gravitational control?

00:14:54.920 --> 00:14:57.350
There's no mistake about it.
They have the same abilities.

00:14:59.190 --> 00:15:02.060
If they're the same as the Ryvius,
perhaps they also have a Vital Guarder.

00:15:02.760 --> 00:15:04.100
Quite likely.

00:15:04.100 --> 00:15:05.650
E-Enemy vessel!

00:15:07.330 --> 00:15:08.860
The enemy vessel is heading for us!

00:15:09.470 --> 00:15:10.270
What did you say?

00:15:10.270 --> 00:15:11.840
But that's too soon!

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:14.310
I'll focus our field
development to our rear.

00:15:14.540 --> 00:15:15.870
- Hurry!
- I'm doing it!

00:15:33.960 --> 00:15:36.950
<i>Blue, the enemy vessel is headed</i>
<i>toward us! What are your orders?</i>

00:15:37.460 --> 00:15:39.170
<i>We'll be destroyed</i>
<i>unless we do something!</i>

00:15:39.170 --> 00:15:42.530
Ikumi! What should we do?
Tell me! Faina!

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:44.700
The Ryvius will be okay.

00:15:45.870 --> 00:15:50.780
H-How can you say that? You have
no basis for that remark! Ikumi!

00:15:50.780 --> 00:15:52.140
Calm down, Kouji!

00:15:52.140 --> 00:15:55.670
So he finally shows his true face.
My stupid opportunistic brother!

00:15:55.850 --> 00:15:57.150
<i>We're gonna hit! Oh, no!</i>

00:15:57.150 --> 00:15:58.620
At least be prepared for the inevitable!

00:15:59.090 --> 00:16:01.820
No... I can't!

00:16:02.590 --> 00:16:03.790
<i>Somebody!</i>

00:16:03.790 --> 00:16:05.090
Four seconds to contact!

00:16:05.690 --> 00:16:07.060
<i>Somebody, help me!</i>

00:16:07.060 --> 00:16:07.680
Kouji!

00:16:24.710 --> 00:16:28.150
<i>Huh? What's this? That's strange.</i>

00:16:28.780 --> 00:16:30.480
<i>Is this what it feels like to be dead?</i>

00:16:32.820 --> 00:16:34.450
<i>I'm nothing but scared.</i>

00:16:39.230 --> 00:16:40.690
<i>This is like a revolving lantern.</i>

00:16:42.560 --> 00:16:46.590
<i>What's going on? Will you put</i>
<i>it to rest? All I see is Aoi.</i>

00:16:48.730 --> 00:16:53.300
<i>You're unusual, Kouji. You try</i>
<i>to be cool, but you're careless.</i>

00:16:53.740 --> 00:16:56.040
<i>You're serious, but your</i>
<i>grades aren't that great.</i>

00:16:56.680 --> 00:16:58.910
<i>You love fights but can't fight yourself.</i>

00:16:59.180 --> 00:17:00.180
<i>Shut up.</i>

00:17:00.180 --> 00:17:03.310
<i>And that too. You're quick to sulk, Kouji.</i>

00:17:03.650 --> 00:17:05.780
<i>Well, then I'm sorry. Satisfied?</i>

00:17:06.050 --> 00:17:08.180
<i>Don't try to end a conversation like that.</i>

00:17:08.750 --> 00:17:12.490
<i>If you have something to say, then say it.</i>
<i>Otherwise, how am I supposed to know?</i>

00:17:13.130 --> 00:17:16.580
<i>There's no connection</i>
<i>there, right? Please, Kouji.</i>

00:17:20.200 --> 00:17:22.460
<i>I... well I!</i>

00:17:25.300 --> 00:17:26.270
I...!

00:17:26.910 --> 00:17:30.170
I'll reduce field energy output as much
as possible so the enemy won't see us.

00:17:30.410 --> 00:17:31.610
Stop doing stuff on your own!

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:33.710
- Then please give me orders.
- You guys are the Zwei members!

00:17:33.710 --> 00:17:34.710
Are we safe?

00:17:34.710 --> 00:17:37.710
For now. But the battle continues.

00:17:40.150 --> 00:17:42.420
We're commencing emergency lift off.

00:17:43.190 --> 00:17:46.720
We're inside Geduld. Don't forget to
cover the Lift ship with a field as well.

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:52.160
Solids, all up! Easy!

00:17:52.230 --> 00:17:54.670
Way to go, Cullen!
Yuki, it's all yours!

00:17:54.770 --> 00:17:56.030
Vital Guarder.

00:17:57.800 --> 00:17:59.030
Lift off!

00:18:00.110 --> 00:18:04.270
Field fixed on default.
82 percent of puppet wires mobile.

00:18:11.220 --> 00:18:12.680
Lift off, complete.

00:18:15.390 --> 00:18:16.890
Is it the same model ship?

00:18:16.890 --> 00:18:19.690
If their battle power is equal to ours,
they have the advantage.

00:18:21.690 --> 00:18:26.720
So we can't escape. Dead or alive,
we have no choice but to fight them.

00:18:35.840 --> 00:18:37.930
Pinger responding, from double to triple.

00:18:38.480 --> 00:18:40.640
Target appears to have
activated their Vital Guarder.

00:18:41.310 --> 00:18:45.980
The Black Ryvius. You shall show me your
abilities. And then, I will crush you.

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:52.650
With our Vaia ship,
The Blue Impulse's Vorticular Drill!

00:19:11.110 --> 00:19:13.510
We shall activate our
Vital Guarder as well.

00:19:13.780 --> 00:19:15.710
We'll be sure to tear them apart
with our ramming attack!

00:19:16.520 --> 00:19:19.040
This Blue Impulse shall
not grant you mercy!

00:19:48.310 --> 00:19:49.540
They divided into two?

00:19:50.050 --> 00:19:51.980
There's no doubt, it's
the enemy's Vital Guarder.

00:19:54.020 --> 00:19:55.710
The enemy's?
No way.

00:19:56.220 --> 00:19:57.980
Looks like ours has been activated too.

00:20:00.260 --> 00:20:02.250
Hurry! We're gonna protect the Ryvius!

00:20:02.490 --> 00:20:04.260
Aren't you gonna stop me today?

00:20:04.260 --> 00:20:06.320
If we're fighting a Vital Guarder,
it should be un-manned.

00:20:06.700 --> 00:20:08.060
We can destroy them without reservation.

00:20:08.230 --> 00:20:10.000
Sounds like fun. Lets see what you can do.

00:20:10.570 --> 00:20:12.040
I'm wearing my "serious" hat.

00:20:14.640 --> 00:20:18.040
I'd better be prepared for
the worst-case scenario.

00:20:26.220 --> 00:20:27.650
What's our target?

00:20:27.650 --> 00:20:29.890
We're fixed onto the
enemy Vital Guarder.

00:20:29.890 --> 00:20:34.760
We'll smash it, break it, and blow it up as
we ram into it at full speed sub-rotation.

00:20:34.760 --> 00:20:36.530
It shall become debris! We'll
show it what Impulse is made of!

00:20:36.530 --> 00:20:37.130
Yes, sir!

00:20:37.130 --> 00:20:41.530
This first battle between Vaia ships,
our Blue Impulse shall be victorious!

00:20:41.970 --> 00:20:43.600
Settings are complete for
our attack on target.

00:20:43.600 --> 00:20:46.090
Good! Specialty charge!

00:20:46.270 --> 00:20:47.300
Charge!

00:20:58.820 --> 00:21:01.120
The enemy is moving at
an incredible speed!

00:21:01.520 --> 00:21:04.350
They're heading straight for us.
They'll get here in thirty seconds!

00:21:04.590 --> 00:21:07.530
Cullen! Load Solid DE-45!

00:21:08.130 --> 00:21:09.830
And DG322 too, right?

00:21:09.830 --> 00:21:12.490
Right! Yuki! I'll leave the
operation of the right arm to you!

00:21:12.970 --> 00:21:14.930
Hit the enemy on the side
with all your might!

00:21:16.200 --> 00:21:17.600
Fix output at 70.

00:21:18.140 --> 00:21:21.470
I'm switching to RK-30
upon completion of DG-323!

00:21:24.780 --> 00:21:26.240
Avoid it and hit it!

00:21:27.310 --> 00:21:28.640
I see what you're getting at!

00:21:37.260 --> 00:21:39.190
The Vital Guarder is in
contact with the enemy!

00:21:39.430 --> 00:21:41.720
Damn. It's traveling too
fast for us to catch up!

00:21:42.130 --> 00:21:43.530
<i>Ikumi... Yuki!</i>

00:21:45.730 --> 00:21:48.260
I heard you talk in delirium, Kouji.

00:21:49.740 --> 00:21:51.440
Talk in delirium?

00:21:51.440 --> 00:21:54.130
Yes. You said "Aoi".

00:22:00.250 --> 00:22:01.210
<i>Kouji.</i>

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:11.780
In your dry eyes...

00:22:11.780 --> 00:22:16.850
...a silhouette appears

00:22:16.850 --> 00:22:21.550
The blue colored future...

00:22:21.550 --> 00:22:28.290
...swayed and glittered

00:22:29.460 --> 00:22:37.700
Ah... No one wants...

00:22:37.700 --> 00:22:46.310
...freedom out of pity

00:22:46.310 --> 00:22:54.750
Ah... To the days I feared...

00:22:54.750 --> 00:22:58.660
...that I'd end up hurting someone,

00:22:58.660 --> 00:23:05.030
goodbye

00:23:09.090 --> 00:23:10.290
Infinite Ryvius

00:23:10.290 --> 00:23:12.490
Infinite Ryvius
Next episode: Swept Away
Counterattack on the Vital Guarder...!

00:23:12.490 --> 00:23:15.060
Next episode: Swept Away
The secret behind the enemy's
space shooting battle...!

00:23:15.060 --> 00:23:17.360
Next episode: Swept Away
Having lost the one thing
keeping our mind at ease...

00:23:17.360 --> 00:23:19.100
Next episode: Swept Away
...we find ourselves swept
away by circumstances...

00:23:19.100 --> 00:23:21.300
Next episode: Swept Away
...as we become...
selfish and egotistical.

00:23:21.300 --> 00:23:22.230
Next episode: Swept Away

00:23:22.230 --> 00:23:23.730
Next episode: Swept Away
I can hear someone ridicule me.

00:23:23.730 --> 00:23:24.470
Next episode: Swept Away

00:23:24.470 --> 00:23:26.170
Next episode: Swept Away
Saying that it is one's true nature.

00:23:26.170 --> 00:23:28.240
Next episode: Swept Away
That it's my true nature.

00:23:28.240 --> 00:23:29.300
Next episode: Swept Away
